    ["HumanEval/39", "Write the complete Python function `prime_fib` for this signature and docstring:\n\n\n\ndef prime_fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    prime_fib returns n-th number that is a Fibonacci number and it's also prime.\n    >>> prime_fib(1)\n    2\n    >>> prime_fib(2)\n    3\n    >>> prime_fib(3)\n    5\n    >>> prime_fib(4)\n    13\n    >>>…", "rrrrrrr", [2476, 7702, 9268, 10733, 2968, 6282, 5931], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["…+ b a, b = b, c if is_prime(c): primes_fib.append(c) return primes_fib[n-1] ```", "…primality, ensuring that we find the required prime numbers in the sequence.", "…in a straightforward manner, providing an effective solution to the problem.", "…only generate numbers that meet both criteria before returning the nth result."]],
