    ["HumanEval/46", "Write the complete Python function `fib4` for this signature and docstring:\n\n\n\ndef fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"The Fib4 number sequence is a sequence similar to the Fibbonacci sequnece that's defined as follows:\n    fib4(0) -> 0\n    fib4(1) -> 0\n    fib4(2) -> 2\n    fib4(3) -> 0\n    fib4(n) -> fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) +…", "rrrrrww", [14156, 15691, 5817, 4998, 6117, 9716, 3984], ["", "", "", "", "", "AssertionError", "IndexError: list assignment index out of…"], ["…= [prev_terms[1], prev_terms[2], prev_terms[3], result] return result ```", "…of the sequence values, but this is necessary to avoid redundant calculations.", "…by leveraging an iterative approach and dynamic programming principles.", "…with a time complexity of O(n), making it suitable for large values of n."]],
